{"type":"text","text":" is a high-level passkey client that runs WebAuthn ceremonies against a YubiKey."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the entry point for WebAuthn in this SDK. It wraps a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and translates W3C WebAuthn requests into CTAP2 protocol exchanges — building the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientDataJSON","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", validating the relying-party identifier against the configured","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", selecting between PIN and built-in user verification, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"processing extensions before the request reaches the authenticator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for any app that runs passkey ceremonies. Reach for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly only when you need lower-level access — raw "},{"code":"makeCredential","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"getAssertion","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", credential management, or bio enrollment."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"text":" is an actor; a client’s lifetime is bound to the underlying ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference",